{%- comment -%}
  Outputs 'true' when the Bundle Builder discount config metaobject is resolvable,
  else 'false'. Single source of truth: Theme settings → Bundle Discounts, with the
  fixed app metaobject (handle: config) as a fallback — mirrors how the Bundle Builder
  drawer and cart progress bar resolve it.

  Used to gracefully degrade when the config is missing:
    - hide the Bundle Builder CTA site-wide (so the drawer can't be opened)
    - empty a stale bundle cart on cart open
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign config_entry = settings.bundle_discount_config
  unless config_entry
    assign config_entry = shop.metaobjects['app--385259831297--bundle_discount_config'].config
  endunless
  if config_entry
    echo 'true'
  else
    echo 'false'
  endif
-%}
